== Effects ==
* Reveals the current floor's entire map, except for the {{r|Super Secret Room}} and {{r|Ultra Secret Room}}.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|r}} '''XXI - The World''' cannot appear in [[greed mode]].

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Book of Secrets|r}}: The mapping provided by '''XXI - The World''' does not count as a mapping effect. The amount of times the Book of Secrets must be used before activating the {{i|X-Ray Vision}} effect remains the same.
* {{I|Tarot Cloth}}: No effect.

